cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these data, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Annular liquid jets: solvers and data for exact constraint absorption and finite-time loss of transversality"
abstract: >-
  Chebyshev collocation solvers for the one-dimensional model of annular
  liquid jets in which the algebraic constraint at the free end is absorbed
  identically, together with an independent third-order upwind
  finite-difference solver, the drivers that regenerate every table and
  figure of the accompanying paper, and the resulting data.
type: software
